    "sentence_translations": [
      "Do You Want to Ride the Panda Train?",
      "",
      "Everyone knows that if you want to see pandas you should go to Chengdu.",
      "Because Chengdu has a very famous panda research institute which houses over 100 panda bears.",
      "Soon you will not only be able to see pandas inside the research institute, but also on the Chengdu subway, ..",
      ".. because a panda themed subway train is about to be launched.",
      "This panda themed train will have panda portraits on the seat walls and armrests, ..",
      ".. and the poles in the carriage are styled like bamboo, so that when you enter the train you feel like you are in panda land.",
      "",
      "Some netizens said: “That's adorable, I would never want to get off!”",
      "Some netizens from other areas also said: “So Chengdu has a panda subway. Perhaps Beijing should have a Peking Duck subway?”"
    ]
